+```text
+excluded: 101, 103, 106, 107, 109, 113, 118
+allowed:  102(17,34), 104(26), 105(21,35), 108(18,27,36),
+          110(22), 111(37), 112(16,28), 114(19,38), 115(23),
+          116(29), 117(39), 119(17), 120(20,24,30,40)
+```
