+* GGV defines `B` as the minimum gcd of total degrees over counterexamples
+  (`gv.txt:693-700`) and proves `B>=16` (`gv.txt:1761-1769`).
+* Moh searches `deg f=m < deg g=n <= 100` with constant Jacobian and
