+Together with `MIN`, a degree-minimal counterexample has
+
+```text
+deg P = Kd, deg Q = Ke, gcd(d,e)=1, d,e>=2, d!=e, max(d,e)>=3,
+K=gcd(deg P,deg Q)>=16.
+```
